=== min() and max() Function Tests ===

1. Simple numeric array (min):
   Array:  [3, 1, 4, 1, 5, 9, 2, 6]
   Original unchanged:  [3, 1, 4, 1, 5, 9, 2, 6]
   min(arr1):  1

2. Simple numeric array (max):
   Array:  [3, 1, 4, 1, 5, 9, 2, 6]
   Original unchanged:  [3, 1, 4, 1, 5, 9, 2, 6]
   max(arr2):  9

3. String array (min):
   Array:  ["zebra", "apple", "banana", "cherry"]
   Original unchanged:  ["zebra", "apple", "banana", "cherry"]
   min(arr3):  apple

4. String array (max):
   Array:  ["zebra", "apple", "banana", "cherry"]
   Original unchanged:  ["zebra", "apple", "banana", "cherry"]
   max(arr4):  zebra

5. Mixed types - min (numbers before strings):
   Array:  ["hello", 42, "world", 10, "test", 5]
   Original unchanged:  ["hello", 42, "world", 10, "test", 5]
   min(arr5):  5

6. Mixed types - max (numbers before strings):
   Array:  ["hello", 42, "world", 10, "test", 5]
   Original unchanged:  ["hello", 42, "world", 10, "test", 5]
   max(arr6):  world

7. Two arguments (min):
   min(5, 3):  3
   min(3, 5):  3
   min("apple", "zebra"):  apple
   min("zebra", "apple"):  apple
   min(10, "5"):  5
   min("5", 10):  5

8. Two arguments (max):
   max(5, 3):  5
   max(3, 5):  5
   max("apple", "zebra"):  zebra
   max("zebra", "apple"):  zebra
   max(10, "5"):  10
   max("5", 10):  10

9. Single scalar argument (min):
   min(42):  42
   min("hello"):  hello
   min(3.14):  3.14

10. Single scalar argument (max):
   max(42):  42
   max("hello"):  hello
   max(3.14):  3.14

11. Associative array (string keys) - min:
   Array:  ["zebra" => 1, "apple" => 1, "banana" => 1]
   Original unchanged:  ["zebra" => 1, "apple" => 1, "banana" => 1]
   min(assoc1):  1

12. Associative array (string keys) - max:
   Array:  ["zebra" => 1, "apple" => 1, "banana" => 1]
   Original unchanged:  ["zebra" => 1, "apple" => 1, "banana" => 1]
   max(assoc2):  1

13. Associative array (numeric keys) - min:
   Array:  [10 => "ten", 2 => "two", 5 => "five", 1 => "one"]
   Original unchanged:  [10 => "ten", 2 => "two", 5 => "five", 1 => "one"]
   min(num_assoc1):  five

14. Associative array (numeric keys) - max:
   Array:  [10 => "ten", 2 => "two", 5 => "five", 1 => "one"]
   Original unchanged:  [10 => "ten", 2 => "two", 5 => "five", 1 => "one"]
   max(num_assoc2):  two

15. Single element array:
   Array [42]:  [42]
   min([42]):  42
   max([42]):  42
   Array ["hello"]:  ["hello"]
   min(["hello"]):  hello
   max(["hello"]):  hello

16. Case sensitivity (min):
   Array:  ["abc", "aBc", "ABC", "Abc", "aBC", "abC"]
   Original unchanged:  ["abc", "aBc", "ABC", "Abc", "aBC", "abC"]
   min(case_arr1):  ABC

17. Case sensitivity (max):
   Array:  ["abc", "aBc", "ABC", "Abc", "aBC", "abC"]
   Original unchanged:  ["abc", "aBc", "ABC", "Abc", "aBC", "abC"]
   max(case_arr2):  abc

18. Case sensitivity (lowercase vs uppercase) - min:
   Array:  ["zebra", "ZEBRA", "apple", "APPLE", "banana", "BANANA"]
   Original unchanged:  ["zebra", "ZEBRA", "apple", "APPLE", "banana", "BANANA"]
   min(case_arr3):  APPLE
   max(case_arr3):  zebra

19. Multidimensional array (min):
   Array:  ["12" => 30, "45" => 10, "23" => 20]
   Original unchanged:  ["12" => 30, "45" => 10, "23" => 20]
   min(multidim1):  10

