   Array:  ["12" => "zebra", "45" => "apple", "23" => "banana"]
   Original unchanged:  ["12" => "zebra", "45" => "apple", "23" => "banana"]
   max(multidim4):  zebra

23. Multidimensional array (mixed types) - min:
   Array:  ["12" => "hello", "45" => 42, "23" => "world", "34" => 10]
   Original unchanged:  ["12" => "hello", "45" => 42, "23" => "world", "34" => 10]
   min(multidim5):  10

24. Multidimensional array (mixed types) - max:
   Array:  ["12" => "hello", "45" => 42, "23" => "world", "34" => 10]
   Original unchanged:  ["12" => "hello", "45" => 42, "23" => "world", "34" => 10]
   max(multidim6):  world

25. Three-dimensional array - min:
   Array:  ["123" => 50, "111" => 10, "222" => 30, "121" => 20]
   Original unchanged:  ["123" => 50, "111" => 10, "222" => 30, "121" => 20]
   min(cube1):  10

26. Three-dimensional array - max:
   Array:  ["123" => 50, "111" => 10, "222" => 30, "121" => 20]
   Original unchanged:  ["123" => 50, "111" => 10, "222" => 30, "121" => 20]
   max(cube2):  50

27. Multidimensional array (string indices) - min:
   Array:  ["row1col1" => 100, "row2col1" => 50, "row1col2" => 75]
   Original unchanged:  ["row1col1" => 100, "row2col1" => 50, "row1col2" => 75]
   min(multidim7):  50

28. Multidimensional array (string indices) - max:
   Array:  ["row1col1" => 100, "row2col1" => 50, "row1col2" => 75]
   Original unchanged:  ["row1col1" => 100, "row2col1" => 50, "row1col2" => 75]
