29. Nested arrays (arrays containing arrays) - min:
   Array:  [[1, 2], [3, 4], [5, 6]]
   Original unchanged:  [[1, 2], [3, 4], [5, 6]]
   min(nested1):  [1, 2]

30. Nested arrays (arrays containing arrays) - max:
   Array:  [[1, 2], [3, 4], [5, 6]]
   Original unchanged:  [[1, 2], [3, 4], [5, 6]]
   max(nested2):  [5, 6]

31. Nested arrays (associative inner arrays) - min:
   Array:  [["a" => 1, "b" => 2], ["c" => 3, "d" => 4]]
   Original unchanged:  [["a" => 1, "b" => 2], ["c" => 3, "d" => 4]]
   min(nested3):  ["a" => 1, "b" => 2]

32. Nested arrays (associative inner arrays) - max:
   Array:  [["a" => 1, "b" => 2], ["c" => 3, "d" => 4]]
   Original unchanged:  [["a" => 1, "b" => 2], ["c" => 3, "d" => 4]]
   max(nested4):  ["c" => 3, "d" => 4]

33. Mixed nested arrays - min:
   Array:  [[1, 2], ["a" => 3, "b" => 4], [5, 6]]
   Original unchanged:  [[1, 2], ["a" => 3, "b" => 4], [5, 6]]
   min(nested5):  ["a" => 3, "b" => 4]

34. Mixed nested arrays - max:
   Array:  [[1, 2], ["a" => 3, "b" => 4], [5, 6]]
   Original unchanged:  [[1, 2], ["a" => 3, "b" => 4], [5, 6]]
   max(nested6):  [5, 6]

