   Array:  [3.14, 2.71, 1.41, 4.67, 0.5]
   Original unchanged:  [3.14, 2.71, 1.41, 4.67, 0.5]
   max(float_arr2):  4.67

37. Mixed integers and floats - min:
   Array:  [10, 5.5, 20, 1.1, 15]
   Original unchanged:  [10, 5.5, 20, 1.1, 15]
   min(mixed_num1):  1.1

38. Mixed integers and floats - max:
   Array:  [10, 5.5, 20, 1.1, 15]
   Original unchanged:  [10, 5.5, 20, 1.1, 15]
   max(mixed_num2):  20

39. Numeric strings vs actual numbers - min:
   Array:  [10, "5", 20, "15", 3]
   Original unchanged:  [10, "5", 20, "15", 3]
   min(numstr1):  3

40. Numeric strings vs actual numbers - max:
   Array:  [10, "5", 20, "15", 3]
   Original unchanged:  [10, "5", 20, "15", 3]
   max(numstr2):  20

